note: engine.py is the unmodified 0.3.1 byte copy. analyze, apply_target, and inject formulas are untouched. AMOE 1.3 keeps this tip. The 1.3 paint-law plate names SpectralLock 0.3.0; this tree was already 0.3.1, so 0.3.1 stays vendored. The local page shell and the command welcome in this package were adjusted for reading. AMOE does not reimplement the pigment path. Wheel paint and triad densitometry stay separate.
